  "brain_first": "“看文章的功能、格式和读者，不要只看主题。”",
  "sort_order": 1028,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Where is this text most likely from?",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1238
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "来源题识别 advertisement, travel guide, news",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1239
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "report, science magazine, website, book review,",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1240
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "notice 等。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1241
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “看文章的功能、格式和读者，不要只看主题。”",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1242
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 同一主题可以出现在不同文体，关键是表达方式和信息功能。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1243
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1244
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 看标题/小标题/价格/联系方式/发布日期等格式。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1245
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 看是否有作者评价、数据报道、操作说明或购买信息。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1246
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 判断目标读者。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1247
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 用“如果真来自这个地方，它为什么要这样写？”验证。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1248
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1249
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1250
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1251
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 价格+开放时间+预订 → website/brochure/guide",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1252
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 事件时间地点+引用 → news report",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1253
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 研究发现+通俗解释 → science magazine",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1254
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 评价一本书+优缺点 → book review",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1255
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 来源能解释格式、语气和功能。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1256
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 主题相同不代表来源相同；优先看文本“要读者做什么”。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1257
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1258
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文章列景点开放时间、票价、交通和“Book now”。更像旅游/场馆网站，不是新闻报道。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1259
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1260
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 根据主题机械判断。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1261
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略格式线索。",
      "sourcePage": 45,
      "sourceIndex": 1262
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1263
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 功能匹配吗？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1264
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 目标读者是谁？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1265
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1266
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1267
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1268
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 出处看功能和格式，不只看主题。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1269
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1271
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 价格+开放时间+Book now更像？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1272
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. byline+date+事件报道更像？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1273
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 实验方法+结果更像？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1274
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. “reviewer gives rating”更像？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1275
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 出处题只看主题够吗？",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1276
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. website/advertisement/travel guide；2. news report；3. science/research article；4. book/film",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1277
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "review；5. 不够，要看格式和语言功能。",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1278
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R14 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R14”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 46,
      "sourceIndex": 1279
    }
  ],
